      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The executive team must immediately reframe \"proactive safety curation\" not as a compromise of neutrality, but as the defining characteristic of a modern, high-sophistication platform that actively protects users from harmful content.\nMoving away from a \"neutral pipe\" model is essential because it demonstrates technical maturity and a commitment to ethical responsibility, which are the exact traits that top-tier engineering talent demands in today's global ecosystem.\nWe should position this shift as a strategic evolution that proves we are a frontier-tech leader capable of managing complex societal challenges, rather than a passive utility that risks obsolescence.\nThis approach will not only attract the best minds but also solidify our brand as a responsible, forward-thinking entity that prioritizes user safety and long-term societal impact.",
